#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php patsch9-rental-engine.php:186
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php:192
msgid "Patsch9 Rental Engine for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Patsch9 Rental Engine for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "https://github.com/patsch9/patsch9-rental-engine"
msgstr "https://github.com/patsch9/patsch9-rental-engine"

#. Description of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid ""
"Rental and equipment booking workflows for WooCommerce with availability, "
"pricing, security deposits, terms, documents, and handover/return "
"management."
msgstr ""
"Miet- und Gerätebuchungsabläufe für WooCommerce mit Verfügbarkeit, Preisen, "
"Kautionen, Mietbedingungen, Dokumenten sowie Übergabe- und "
"Rückgabeverwaltung."

#. Author of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "Patrick Schmidt"
msgstr "Patrick Schmidt"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: patsch9-rental-engine.php
msgid "https://github.com/patsch9"
msgstr "https://github.com/patsch9"

#: includes/class-rmwc-legacy-migration.php:289
msgid "Patsch9 Rental Engine migration stopped."
msgstr "Migration der Patsch9 Rental Engine wurde gestoppt."

#: includes/class-rmwc-legacy-migration.php:291
msgid ""
"Both the historic and canonical rental database tables contain data. No "
"automatic merge was attempted to avoid corrupting reservations or documents."
" Please create a database backup and resolve the duplicate table set before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"Sowohl die historischen als auch die neuen Vermietungstabellen enthalten "
"Daten. Um Reservierungen oder Dokumente nicht zu beschädigen, wurde keine "
"automatische Zusammenführung durchgeführt. Bitte erstelle ein Datenbank-"
"Backup und löse den doppelten Tabellenbestand, bevor du fortfährst."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:259 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:266
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1086 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1094
msgid "Please select a valid rental period."
msgstr "Bitte einen gültigen Mietzeitraum wählen."

#. translators: %s: Localized weekday name.
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:277
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pickup or rental start is not available on %s. Please choose a different "
"start date."
msgstr ""
"Am %s ist keine Abholung bzw. kein Mietbeginn möglich. Bitte einen anderen "
"Starttag wählen."

#. translators: %s: Localized weekday name.
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:277 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:284
msgid "selected weekday"
msgstr "gewählten Wochentag"

#. translators: %s: Localized weekday name.
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:284
#, php-format
msgid "Return is not available on %s. Please choose a different return date."
msgstr ""
"Am %s ist keine Rückgabe möglich. Bitte einen anderen Rückgabetag wählen."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:303 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:313
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:643
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-integrations.php:58
msgid "Rental"
msgstr "Vermietung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:304
msgid "Offer this WooCommerce product as a rental item."
msgstr "Dieses WooCommerce-Produkt als Mietartikel anbieten."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:338
msgid "Basic data & times"
msgstr "Grunddaten & Zeiten"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:343
msgid "Default billing"
msgstr "Standard-Abrechnung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:344
msgid "per day"
msgstr "pro Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:344
msgid "per week (7 rental days)"
msgstr "pro Woche (7 Miettage)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:344
msgid "per month (30 rental days)"
msgstr "pro Monat (30 Miettage)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:345
msgid ""
"Used if no price scale or weekend rule applies. For daily billing, "
"individual weekdays may overwrite the standard price."
msgstr ""
"Wird verwendet, wenn keine Preisstaffel oder Wochenendregel greift. Bei "
"Tagesabrechnung können einzelne Wochentage den Standardpreis überschreiben."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:351
msgid "Standard rental price"
msgstr "Standard-Mietpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:358
msgid "Available quantity"
msgstr "Verfügbare Anzahl"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:362
msgid ""
"How many identical rental units of this product can be rented at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele identische Geräte dieses Produkts gleichzeitig vermietet werden "
"können."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:368 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:2834
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:2854
msgid "Pickup / rental start"
msgstr "Abhol-/Mietbeginn"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:371
msgid ""
"Example: 12:00. The booking starts at this time on the selected start date."
msgstr ""
"Beispiel: 12:00. Ab diesem Zeitpunkt beginnt die Buchung am gewählten "
"Startdatum."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:377
msgid "Return time"
msgstr "Rückgabezeit"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:380
msgid "Example: 10:00. By this time the item must be back on the return date."
msgstr ""
"Beispiel: 10:00. Bis zu diesem Zeitpunkt muss der Artikel am Rückgabedatum "
"zurück sein."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:390
msgid ""
"Rental days are calculated from the actual period and rounded up to full "
"days."
msgstr ""
"Miettage werden aus der tatsächlichen Zeitspanne berechnet und auf volle "
"Tage aufgerundet."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:396
msgid "Maximum rental period"
msgstr "Maximale Mietdauer"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:399 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:417
msgid "0 or empty = unlimited."
msgstr "0 oder leer = unbegrenzt."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:404
msgid "Buffer after return (hours)"
msgstr "Puffer nach Rückgabe (Std.)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:408
msgid ""
"Additional buffer time after return, e.g. 2 hours for cleaning and "
"inspection."
msgstr ""
"Zusätzliche Sperrzeit nach der Rückgabe, z. B. 2 Stunden für Reinigung und "
"Kontrolle."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:414
msgid "Max. advance booking (days)"
msgstr "Max. Vorausbuchung (Tage)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:424
msgid "Weekdays & blocked days"
msgstr "Wochentage & Sperrtage"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:425
msgid ""
"Determine on which weekdays collection and return are possible and whether a"
" different daily price applies on individual rental days. Current rentals "
"may bridge blocked delivery days."
msgstr ""
"Lege fest, an welchen Wochentagen Abholung und Rückgabe möglich sind und ob "
"an einzelnen Miettagen ein abweichender Tagespreis gilt. Laufende "
"Vermietungen dürfen gesperrte Übergabetage überbrücken."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:434
msgid "No pickup"
msgstr "Keine Abholung"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:435
msgid "No rental start on this day"
msgstr "Kein Mietbeginn an diesem Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:441
msgid "No return"
msgstr "Keine Rückgabe"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:442
msgid "No return on this day"
msgstr "Keine Rückgabe an diesem Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:446
msgid "Daily price"
msgstr "Tagespreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:454
msgid "Standard price"
msgstr "Standardpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:457
msgid "Empty = standard rental price"
msgstr "Leer = Standard-Mietpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:465
msgid "Security deposit & handover"
msgstr "Kaution & Übergabe"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:470 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1015
#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:1845 includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:3245
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:467
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:468
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-documents.php:664
#: includes/v2/modules/class-rmwc-v2-workflow.php:639
msgid "Security deposit"
msgstr "Kaution"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:473
msgid "Refundable security deposit per rental unit."
msgstr "Rückzahlbare Sicherheitsleistung je vermietetem Gerät."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:479
msgid "Security deposit note"
msgstr "Hinweis zur Kaution"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:480
msgid "e.g. refunded after the returned item has been inspected."
msgstr "z. B. Wird nach Prüfung der Rückgabe zurückerstattet."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:481
msgid ""
"Optional free text displayed on the product page at the deposit amount."
msgstr ""
"Optionaler Freitext, der beim Kautionsbetrag auf der Produktseite angezeigt "
"wird."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:493
msgid "Allow pickup"
msgstr "Abholung erlauben"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:498
msgid "Allow delivery"
msgstr "Lieferung erlauben"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:499
msgid "Enabled: delivery by rental operator and return by customer."
msgstr "Ermöglicht: Lieferung durch Vermieter und Rückgabe durch Kunde."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:505
msgid "Allow delivery and collection"
msgstr "Lieferung + Abholung erlauben"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:507
msgid ""
"Allows: delivery and later collection by the rental operator. The transport "
"price is charged per journey (return journey = 2 × price)."
msgstr ""
"Ermöglicht: Lieferung und spätere Abholung durch den Vermieter. Der "
"Transportpreis wird je Fahrt berechnet (Hin- und Rückfahrt = 2 × Preis)."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:513
msgid "Fallback transport fee per journey"
msgstr "Fallback-Transportpauschale je Fahrt"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:516
msgid ""
"Only used if no delivery zones are defined. The amount is per journey; at "
"delivery and collection it is charged twice."
msgstr ""
"Wird nur verwendet, wenn keine Lieferzonen definiert sind. Der Betrag gilt "
"je Fahrt; bei Lieferung und Abholung wird er zweimal berechnet."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:523
msgid "Flexible pricing tiers"
msgstr "Flexible Preisstaffeln"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:524
msgid ""
"Pricing priority: weekend rate → matching pricing tier → weekday rate → "
"standard price. Example: from 7 rental days, a package price of €129 "
"includes 7 days; each additional rental day costs €15."
msgstr ""
"Preis-Priorität: Wochenendtarif → passende Preisstaffel → Wochentagspreise →"
" Standardpreis. Beispiel: ab 7 Miettagen Paketpreis 129 € inkl. 7 Tage, "
"danach 15 € je weiterem Miettag."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:526
msgid "From day"
msgstr "Ab Tagen"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:526
msgid "Up to day"
msgstr "Bis Tage"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:526
msgid "Package price"
msgstr "Paketpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:526
msgid "Included days"
msgstr "Enthaltene Tage"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:526
msgid "Additional day"
msgstr "Weiterer Tag"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:529
msgid "+ Add pricing tier"
msgstr "+ Preisstaffel"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:533
msgid "Enable weekend rate"
msgstr "Wochenendtarif aktiv"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:534
msgid ""
"Applies only when the start and return weekdays match exactly and the "
"resulting duration is exact (e.g. Friday to Monday = 3 rental days)."
msgstr ""
"Greift nur bei exakt passendem Start-/Rückgabe-Wochentag und genau der "
"daraus folgenden Dauer (z. B. Freitag bis Montag = 3 Miettage)."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:539
msgid "Weekend price"
msgstr "Wochenendpreis"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:545
msgid "Weekend starts"
msgstr "Wochenende beginnt"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:551
msgid "Weekend ends"
msgstr "Wochenende endet"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:559
msgid "Add-ons & rental accessories"
msgstr "Zusatzoptionen & Miet-Zubehör"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:560
msgid ""
"Use rental accessories for material variants and priced accessory items. "
"Simple add-ons are intended for services or surcharges that do not require "
"their own inventory items."
msgstr ""
"Für Materialgrößen und bepreiste Zubehörartikel verwende Miet-Zubehör. "
"Einfache Zusatzoptionen sind für Leistungen oder Aufschläge gedacht, die "
"keinen eigenen Lagerartikel benötigen."

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:563
msgid "Simple add-ons (without a separate WooCommerce product)"
msgstr "Einfache Zusatzoptionen (ohne eigenen WooCommerce-Artikel)"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:566
msgid "Group"
msgstr "Gruppe"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:566
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Option"

#: includes/class-rmwc-plugin.php:566
msgid "Price"
msgstr "Preis"

